.Dd September 19, 2026
.Dt BSDPOWERCTL 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm BSDPowerctl
.Nd operator CLI for the system.Power capability
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm Cm states
.Nm Cm suspend Ar state
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
queries and, with authority, drives ACPI power management through the
.Dq system.Power
capability provider
.Pq Xr BSDPower 8 .
.Bl -tag -width suspend
.It Cm states
Print the supported ACPI sleep states (e.g.\&
.Dq S3 S4 S5 ) .
.It Cm suspend Ar state
Request the machine enter sleep state
.Ar state
(1\(en5).
Fails with
.Er EPERM
unless the caller's label is granted suspend authority in
.Xr BSDPower 8 Ns 's
.Pa power.conf .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr libpowercmp 3 ,
.Xr BSDPower 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Kory Heard
